### ============================================
### AUTHENTICATION TESTS
### Test all authentication routes in order
### ============================================

### 1. REGISTER - Create a new user with email/password
POST http://localhost:5000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "testuser",
    "email": "testuser@example.com",
    "password": "SecurePass123!"
}

### Expected: 201 Created
### Returns: user, accessToken, refreshToken
### Save the tokens for later tests!

###

### 2. LOGIN - Login with email/password
POST http://localhost:5000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "testuser@example.com",
    "password": "SecurePass123!"
}

### Expected: 200 OK
### Returns: user, accessToken, refreshToken
### Note: refreshToken also sent as HTTP-only cookie

###

### 3. GUEST LOGIN - Create a guest user (no credentials needed)
POST http://localhost:5000/auth/guest
Content-Type: application/json

### Expected: 201 Created
### Returns: guest user with auto-generated email, accessToken, refreshToken

###

### 4. TOKEN REFRESH - Get new access token using refresh token
### NOTE: Replace YOUR_REFRESH_TOKEN_HERE with actual token from login/register
POST http://localhost:5000/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: refreshToken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VySWQiOiJlZjYzOGQ0MS1lN2EyLTQ1ZGYtYjI1Zi04ZWE1OTA1MDkzYmEiLCJlbWFpbCI6InRlc3R1c2VyQGV4YW1wbGUuY29tIiwiaXNHdWVzdCI6ZmFsc2UsImlhdCI6MTc3MzE5MDI1MSwiZXhwIjoxNzczNzk1MDUxfQ.lxqRtPLDUQnwhfyQy_dRQor5Y5zMR4NZvWCSXC7J8ac

### Expected: 200 OK
### Returns: new accessToken and refreshToken

###

### 5. LOGOUT - Clear refresh token
### NOTE: Replace YOUR_REFRESH_TOKEN_HERE with actual token
POST http://localhost:5000/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: refreshToken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJ1c2VySWQiOiI0YTQ4YzFlOS00NmFmLTRiODEtODc0ZC0yMmI5ZmM5MWNjOWIiLCJlbWFpbCI6InRlc3R1c2VyQGV4YW1wbGUuY29tIiwiaXNHdWVzdCI6ZmFsc2UsImlhdCI6MTc3MzE3MDYyMywiZXhwIjoxNzczNzc1NDIzfQ.0Jya-o4F7PP2fssek0g9hit3N-PYgcDI0HugiEXK1To

### Expected: 200 OK
### Returns: success message

###

### ============================================
### VALIDATION TESTS - Should Fail
### ============================================

### 6. REGISTER - Invalid email format (should fail)
POST http://localhost:5000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "testuser2",
    "email": "invalid-email",
    "password": "SecurePass123!"
}

### Expected: 400 Bad Request
### Error: Invalid email format

###

### 7. REGISTER - Weak password (should fail)
POST http://localhost:5000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "testuser3",
    "email": "test3@example.com",
    "password": "weak"
}

### Expected: 400 Bad Request
### Error: Password too weak

###

### 8. REGISTER - Missing fields (should fail)
POST http://localhost:5000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "test4@example.com"
}

### Expected: 400 Bad Request
### Error: Missing required fields

###

### 9. REGISTER - Duplicate email (should fail)
POST http://localhost:5000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "duplicate",
    "email": "testuser@example.com",
    "password": "SecurePass123!"
}

### Expected: 400 Bad Request
### Error: User already exists

###

### 10. LOGIN - Wrong password (should fail)
POST http://localhost:5000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "testuser@example.com",
    "password": "WrongPassword123!"
}

### Expected: 401 Unauthorized
### Error: Invalid credentials

###

### 11. LOGIN - Non-existent user (should fail)
POST http://localhost:5000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "nonexistent@example.com",
    "password": "SecurePass123!"
}

### Expected: 401 Unauthorized
### Error: Invalid credentials

###

### 12. REFRESH - Invalid token (should fail)
POST http://localhost:5000/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: refreshToken=invalid.token.here

### Expected: 401 Unauthorized
### Error: Invalid token

###

### ============================================
### OAUTH TESTS - Browser Required
### ============================================

### 13. GOOGLE OAUTH - Initiate Google login
### Open this URL in your browser:
### http://localhost:5000/auth/google
### Expected: Redirects to Google login page
### After auth: Redirects back with tokens

###

### 14. GITHUB OAUTH - Initiate GitHub login
### Open this URL in your browser:
### http://localhost:5000/auth/github
### Expected: Redirects to GitHub login page
### After auth: Redirects back with tokens

###

