### ============================================
### TESTING CHECKLIST
### ============================================
### 
### ✅ Test Order:
### 1. Start server: cd backend && npm run dev
### 2. Test #1 (Register) - Save tokens
### 3. Test #2 (Login) - Verify same user
### 4. Test #3 (Guest) - Verify guest user created
### 5. Test #4 (Refresh) - Update token from step 2
### 6. Test #5 (Logout) - Use token from step 2
### 7. Tests #6-12 - Verify all fail with correct errors
### 8. Tests #13-14 - Open in browser (needs OAuth setup)
###
### Security Checks:
### ✅ Password is never returned in response
### ✅ RefreshToken stored as HTTP-only cookie
### ✅ Validation prevents invalid data
### ✅ Duplicate emails rejected
### ✅ Guest users work without credentials
###
### ============================================ 